(2103, 2103, r'''/* ---------------- lineup builder ----------------
   Six slots, and every suggestion after the first is scored against what is
   already on the bench: a type nothing can hit, a weakness half the team shares,
   an HM nobody carries. Optionally against one specific boss, in which case the
   badge cap moves to that fight and the scoring becomes about that party.

   The offensive model is a species' own types, not its movepool. That is a
   simplification and the app says so -- a Gyarados with Ice Fang is not modelled
   as Ice coverage -- but it is the honest version of a suggestion tool that has
   learnsets and no way to know what four moves you actually carry. */
let team=[], teamTarget='', teamBadges=8;

